{"text": "Yor\n\nFroa:\n\nSubject:\n\n\u00bb PHILIP MORRIS REL\n\nU.S.A. Mi iy\nINTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE FEI\nA RICHMOND, VIRGINIA EAM\n\nDISTRIBUTION\n\nP. A. Eichorn\n\nPhilip Morris National Salesmen's Meeting\n\nThis memo is to fill in a few more details than you may know already\non the National Sales Meeting and the role of R&D in this meeting.\n\nNearly 900 salesmen will come to Richmond for a series of three (3)\nthree day sessions on February 24-26, March 10-12 and March 17-19. -\nDuring each of these sessions, 300 salesmen (two regions) will attend.\nThe sales group will be broken down further into daily numbers of 150\n(one \u00bb region) with half that number (75) touring R&D in the morning,\u2019 the\nhalf touring in the afternoon. These half groups will be touring\nthe \"Manufacturing Center. alternately to R&D.\n\nTour dates are:\n\nFebruary 24 Region 3 (North Central\nFebruary 26 Region 4 (Mountain & Great Plains)\nMarch 10 \u2014_Region 2 (Southeast)\nMarch 12 _ Region 5 (South Central)\nMarch 17 _ Region 6 (Pacific)\nMarch 19 Region 1 (Northeast)\n\nPAE:is\nAttachments\u2019\nDistribution: B sees hein\n/ Dr. H. Wakeham Mr, W. Claflin Mr. M. Bourlas\nMr. F. Resnik Mr. R. Comes Mr. R, Carpenter\nDr. T. Osdene Ms. J. Duggins Mr. W. Carter\nMr. R. Thomson Mr. R. Fenner Mr. J. Charles\n\nMr. K. Burns Dr. R. Ikeda Mr. F. Gager\nMr. F. Daylor Mr. R. Jenkins Ms. B. Mcintyre\nDr. W. Gannon Ms. B. Jones Mr. W. Stephens\nMr. B. Kosakowski Ms. F, Reynolds Mr. G, Vilcins\nDr. D. Lowitz Mr. F, Ryan Mr. D, Watson |\n\nMr. L. Meyer Mr. R. Wiley Mr. L. Weissbecke:\nMr. W. Mutter e i\n\nMr. J. Osmalov\nMr. E. Wickham\nDr. F. Will \u00ab\n\nDr. W. Dunn\nDr. Re Fagan",
